<title>HONG KONG: Trade in China EB Tech shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in China EB Tech shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Everbright Technology Ltd was suspended on Monday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The shares were up HK$0.20 at HK$1.94 before trading was suspended.</p>
<p>China Everbright Technology manufactures television sets and audio products for private-label customers.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
